<title>SPAIN: Spain imports from Russia 1.29 bln dlrs in 1996.</title>
<headline>Spain imports from Russia 1.29 bln dlrs in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish imports from Russia totalled $1.29 billion in 1996, down 10 percent from 1995, the economy ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement 61 percent of the total was accounted for by crude oil.</p>
<p>Spanish exports to Russia in 1996 totalled $590 million, up 45 percent from 1995, with food products accounting for a third of the total.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
